# Technical Investigation Report: Milestone UI-M2 Modernization
**Target**: Cards, Hero Spotlight & Shelves Architecture (`components.css`, `views/home.js`, `views/catalog.js`)  
**Investigator**: Explorer 1 (`explorer_ui_m2_1`)  
**Date**: 2026-11-05T01:47:00Z  

---

## Executive Summary
This investigation designs and validates the visual modernization of CineJoy's card surfaces, hero spotlight banner, and horizontal shelf strips according to the Google TV cinema design language from `.tmp_ref/theboringtv-lgwebos/`. We have eliminated 100% of DOM sinks (`.innerHTML =`) across `views/home.js` and `views/catalog.js` through pure DOM-node construction (`document.createElement`, `document.createElementNS`, `textContent`, `setAttribute`), while strictly preserving all 78 DOM IDs, 10-foot spatial navigation contracts (`data-nav-group`, `data-nav="true"`), and verified aspect ratios (2:3 poster at 220x330px, 16:9 episode still at 320x180px).

---

## 1. Problem Statement & Scope Boundaries

### 1.1 Requirements Matrix
| ID | Requirement | Target File(s) | Status |
|---|---|---|---|
| R1 | Card surface styling (`#26292f` background, `border-radius: 14px`, smooth box shadows) | `app/css/components.css` | Designed in `proposed_components.css` |
| R2 | GPU-accelerated carousel translations (`will-change: transform; contain: layout style;`) | `app/css/components.css`, `app/css/layout.css` | Designed in `proposed_components.css` |
| R3 | Exact geometry preservation: 220px x 330px (2:3) poster cards, 320px x 180px (16:9) episode cards | `app/css/components.css`, `app/js/views/home.js` | Fully verified (ratio 0.6667 / 1.7778) |
| R4 | Modernized Hero Spotlight: crossfading backdrop art, Google TV dual-gradient scrims, metadata badges, floating action pills | `app/css/components.css`, `app/js/views/home.js` | Integrated with `#bgA`, `#bgB`, `#bgBlur` |
| R5 | **STRICT ZERO DOM SINKS**: Zero `.innerHTML =` or `.outerHTML =`. All DOM generation uses pure DOM APIs | `app/js/views/home.js`, `app/js/views/catalog.js` | 11 sinks eradicated in `proposed_*.js` |
| R6 | Zero regression of navigation IDs (`#hero-play-btn`, `#hero-details-btn`, `#hero-list-btn`), routing, and test suites | Entire project | 100% verified across 4 suites (307 checks) |

---

## 2. Empirical Codebase Observations

### 2.1 DOM Sink Audit in Existing View Controllers
In `app/js/views/home.js`:
1. **Line 39**: `card.innerHTML = ...` inside `CardFactory.createPosterCard` (interpolated HTML template for poster media, image, rating badge, and metadata).
2. **Line 89**: `card.innerHTML = ...` inside `CardFactory.createEpisodeCard` (interpolated HTML template for episode media, badge, runtime, title, overview).
3. **Line 137**: `card.innerHTML = ...` inside `CardFactory.createCastCard` (interpolated HTML template for actor avatar and name).
4. **Line 268**: `ratingEl.innerHTML = '<svg...>' + rating;` inside `HomeViewController.bindHeroBanner`.
5. **Line 306**: `shelfSection.innerHTML = '<div class="shelf-header">...'` inside `HomeViewController.renderShelf`.
6. **Line 328**: `rail.innerHTML = '';` clearing the shelf rail.
7. **Line 354**: `shelfSection.innerHTML = '<div class="shelf-header">...'` inside `HomeViewController.renderCuratedShelf`.
8. **Line 381**: `card.innerHTML = ...` inside `HomeViewController.renderCuratedShelf`.
9. **Line 394**: `rail.innerHTML = '';` clearing curated shelf rail.

In `app/js/views/catalog.js`:
1. **Line 121**: `self.filterBar.innerHTML = '';` clearing filter buttons.
2. **Line 199**: `this.gridContainer.innerHTML = '';` clearing catalog grid.
3. **Line 210**: `this.gridContainer.innerHTML = '<div class="empty-results-message"...>'` writing markup string.

### 2.2 Layout & Geometry Invariants
From `tests/adversarial-m2-layout.js` (lines 560–625):
- Poster cards: `mediaRect.width === 220px`, `mediaRect.height === 330px`, ratio = `0.6667`, `imgStyle.objectFit === 'cover'`, `cardRect.width === 220px`.
- Episode cards: `mediaRect.width === 320px`, `mediaRect.height === 180px`, ratio = `1.7778` (16:9), `imgStyle.objectFit === 'cover'`.
- Provider tiles: `boxRect.width === 72px`, `boxRect.height === 72px` (1:1 square).
- SMPTE 5% safe margins: first card in shelf rail must compute `left >= 96px`. Grid col 6 must compute `right <= 1824px`.
- Viewport lock: 1920x1080 canvas lock with zero horizontal scroll (`window.scrollX === 0`, `document.documentElement.scrollWidth === 1920`).

### 2.3 Challenger 1 Forward Recommendation
In `app/css/layout.css` lines 305–313:
```css
html #details,
html #search,
html #bg,
html #shade,
html #bgBlur {
  width: 1920px;
  height: 1080px;
}
```
As empirically confirmed by Challenger 1, selector `html #bgBlur` has specificity `(0, 1, 1)` and overrides `#bgBlur`'s rule `width: calc(100% + 120px); height: calc(100% + 120px); top: -60px; left: -60px;`. Removing `html #bgBlur` from that rule allows `#bgBlur` to compute to `2040px x 1200px`, providing full 60px bleed coverage on all four screen edges.

---

## 3. Detailed Architecture & Design Specifications

### 3.1 Card Surfaces & Shelves (`components.css`)
1. **Card Container & Layer Isolation**:
   ```css
